{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ACT","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"使徒行傳","commonName":"使徒行傳","title":"使徒行傳","order":44,"numberOfChapters":28,"sha256":"068d13b200d44cb28fc6394a3b7949bb5a5f4bc76a70b9034992da88075f1efb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ACT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":28,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ACT/28.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1005},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["選立執事"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["那時，門徒的人數與日俱增。當中有些講希臘話的猶太人埋怨講希伯來話的猶太人，說對方在日常分配食物的事上怠慢了他們的寡婦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["於是，十二使徒召集所有的門徒，對他們說：「我們不應該忽略傳上帝的道，去管理膳食。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["弟兄姊妹，請從你們中間選出七位聲譽良好、充滿聖靈和智慧的人來負責膳食，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["而我們要專心祈禱和傳道。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["大家一致同意，便選出充滿信心和聖靈的司提凡，此外還有腓利、伯羅哥羅、尼迦挪、提門、巴米拿，以及曾信過猶太教、來自安提阿的外族人尼哥拉。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["大家將這七個人帶到使徒面前。使徒為他們禱告並按手在他們身上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["上帝的道興旺起來，耶路撒冷的門徒大大增多，連許多祭司也歸信了。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["司提凡被捕"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["司提凡滿有恩典和能力，在百姓中間行了驚人的神蹟奇事。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但有些來自古利奈、亞歷山大、基利迦和亞細亞、屬於「自由人",{"noteId":11},"會堂」的猶太人聯合起來與司提凡辯論。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["他們無法駁倒司提凡，因為他靠著智慧和聖靈說話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["於是，他們暗中唆使一些人誣告司提凡說：「我們聽見他說褻瀆摩西和上帝的話！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["又煽動百姓、長老和律法教師抓住司提凡，把他押到公會。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["他們還派人作偽證說：「司提凡常常講侮辱聖地",{"noteId":12},"和律法的話。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["我們聽見他說那個拿撒勒人耶穌要毀壞聖殿，還要更改摩西傳給我們的規矩。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["公會在座的人都盯著司提凡，只見他的面容好像天使的面容。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"「自由人」指的是原為奴隸，後來獲得自由的人。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":9}},{"noteId":12,"caller":"+","text":"「聖地」指「聖殿」。","reference":{"chapter":6,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ACT/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ACT/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ACT/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}